        "titolo_orig": "At least 23 people killed in suspected suicide attacks in north-eastern Nigeria",
        "testo_it": "Almeno 23 morti in attentati suicidi in Nigeria, a Maiduguri, contro mercati e ospedali.",
        "priorita": "Media",
        "id_gruppo": 0,
        "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/17/bombings-north-eastern-nigeria-maiduguri",
